    "description": "First-pass tightening of the card-auth cardholder-data-environment segmentation ahead of the QSA assessment. Re-scoped and pruned access rules across the environment's tiers and egress policy. Executed under time pressure; post-change functional and compliance validation was deferred to the platform team.",
