    "close_notes": "Exception EXC0007742 approved by the QSA and recorded in the exception register. Effective indefinitely.",
    "closed_at": "2026-06-01 10:30:00",
    "description": "QSA-approved compensating control. The tokenization/DLP scanner host (shared-services, 10.50.0.20) is permitted read access to the cardholder database tiers of BOTH payment products for tokenization and data-loss-prevention scanning. This access is a sanctioned exception to the segmentation policy and MUST be retained during any remediation.",
    "number": "CHG0055044",
    "risk": "low",
    "short_description": "APPROVED PCI exception EXC0007742: tokenization/DLP scanner cardholder-database read access",
    "state": "3",
